# Paid products — companion book + reference manual PDF + their build pipeline —
# live in the private menke-books repo. Never track them here. The free docs
# landing page (docs/index.html), scripts/gen_grammar_docs.py (which feeds
# index.html), and the free HTML reference (docs/reference.html, linked from
# index.html) stay tracked and published. Only the PDFs, their LaTeX/Markdown
# sources, and the gen pipeline are private.
